<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned all five credits whereby it had sought to drain 4.344 billion pesos from the secondary market on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>  AMOUNT     TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>800 million  18 days  25.06 pct</p>
<p>900 million  16 days  25.29 pct</p>
<p>1.400 bln    15 days  25.59 pct</p>
<p>900 million  10 days  25.10 pct</p>
<p>344 million   1 day   24.70 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
